            },
            {
              "id": "DC_seed_7",
              "bodyHTML": "<p>After reading the thread I think we should:</p><ol><li>Match Gmail's <code>e</code> for archive (people switching from Gmail will thank us).</li><li>Offer both relative durations <em>and</em> a date picker, defaulting to the relative menu.</li><li>Keep <code>?</code> as the global shortcut help overlay.</li></ol><p>Happy to draft the spec PR if there are no objections by Friday.</p>",
              "url": "https://github.com/universal-inbox/universal-inbox/discussions/42#discussioncomment-7",
              "createdAt": "{{ago_4h}}",
              "isAnswer": true,
